    "EnemyIntro": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Designer-authored enemy/boss introduction dialogue windows (feature-enemy-intro-dialogue). Pops up on the right side of the screen at the start of the attacking phase of a chosen round, freezing the world like Levelup/Boss-cutscene, showing an enlarged enemy sprite plus free text. Ships with an empty entries list — nothing shows until entries are authored.",
